'''Lawrence Abell Smith''' (born February 7, 1965) is an American former professional [[American football|football]] [[linebacker]] who played for the [[Houston Oilers]] of the [[National Football League]] (NFL). He played [[college football]] at the [[University of Kentucky]].<ref>{{cite web|url=https://www.pro-football-reference.com/players/S/SmitLa21.htm |title=Larry Smith Stats |publisher=Pro-Football-Reference.com |access-date=2023-04-14}}</ref>
